{
  "name": "switch",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "开关 Switch",
  "description": "带弹簧滑块与完整无障碍语义的二元状态控件。",
  "import": "import { Switch, switchVariants } from \"@/components/ui/switch\"",
  "exports": [
    "Switch",
    "switchVariants"
  ],
  "typeExports": [
    "SwitchProps"
  ],
  "install": {
    "wui": "pnpm dlx @wui-design/cli@latest add @wui/switch",
    "shadcn": "pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add https://ui.wzx.wang/r/switch.json",
    "npmDependencies": [
      "radix-ui",
      "class-variance-authority",
      "motion"
    ],
    "registryDependencies": [
      "utils"
    ]
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "\"default\" | \"sm\" | \"lg\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "default",
        "sm",
        "lg"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "default",
      "description": "Physical size of the switch."
    },
    {
      "name": "disabled",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean"
    },
    {
      "name": "asChild",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean"
    }
  ],
  "usage": "`Switch` 用于让设置立即在开启与关闭之间切换，例如通知、隐私或显示偏好。它基于 Radix Switch，支持鼠标、触摸、键盘以及表单语义；滑块通过 Motion 弹簧运动，并在 `prefers-reduced-motion` 下自动静止降级。\r\n\r\n不要用 Switch 代替需要“提交/取消”的操作；这类场景应使用 Checkbox 或 Button。",
  "extended": "### 尺寸\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n受控用法通过 `checked` 与 `onCheckedChange` 管理；非受控用法使用 `defaultChecked`。",
  "events": "- `onCheckedChange(checked)`：状态变化后触发。\r\n- 原生焦点、键盘与表单属性会继续透传到底层 Radix Root。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "switch-demo",
      "title": "基础示例"
    },
    {
      "name": "switch-sizes",
      "title": "尺寸"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    "registry/ui/switch.tsx"
  ],
  "docsUrl": "https://ui.wzx.wang/docs/components/switch",
  "sourceUrl": "https://ui.wzx.wang/r/switch.json"
}
